      "statement": "Three test users are pre-seeded in the realm for local development: learner@example.com/learner, learner2@example.com/learner2 (both learner role), and admin@example.com/admin (learner + admin roles). The Keycloak admin console is accessible at http://localhost:8080 with admin/admin.",
