    {
      "id": "claim_34bc1d2233d242cb987ce364c0aa647a",
      "statement": "The MCP server validates the forwarded JWT against aud=rag-mcp, reads the sub claim, and uses it to build an SQL predicate restricting all chunk searches to documents owned by that subject (owner_id = sub in Releases 1–3), ensuring access is never decided by the prompt.",
